# Dry-run outputs are regenerable from `scripts/build_newsletter_dryrun.py`
# and read live ranked.json, so they'd churn on every pipeline run. Only the
# hand-authored design reference (pulpo-issue-01-*.html) is tracked.
dryrun-*.html
# `real-*.html` is the same renderer output under the newer naming the
# dry-run script adopted after the free-tier split — they carry an
# `x-pulpo-template` meta tag and rebuild from the same command. The
# original `dryrun-*` pattern never followed the rename, so eight of
# them sat untracked in `git status` for a month before anyone noticed.
real-*.html
*.pdf
